<title>DUBAI: UAE and France to hold military exercises.</title>
<headline>UAE and France to hold military exercises.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Arab Emirates and France will hold joint military exercises in the Gulf Arab state this month, the official WAM news agency reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said the war games would come under military cooperation between the two countries, which are tied by a defence pact.</p>
